# What the figure and table scripts read

The data are `experiment-repo`'s `results/tables/` (delivered to `paper-repo` `results/tables/`; its dictionary is `results/README.md`). The names below are
the delivered ones (the first proposal of this file was replaced by them). A script fails loudly on a missing file or column; absent cells are not drawn.

Common keys: `dataset`, `model`, `estimator` (`shap_kernel` = the unchanged `shap.KernelExplainer`, `kernel_paired`, `permutation_antithetic`), `l1_reg` (`False`, `auto`,
`num_features(10)`, `NA`; read as strings), `budget_m`, `instance_id`. The headline arm is `shap_kernel`, `l1_reg=False`, k = 3.

| Output | Script | Reads | What it draws |
|---|---|---|---|
