| Fig 4 (c, d) | `fig4_budget.py` | `mstar_by_margin`, `mstar_tobit` | interpolated m* per margin quartile (secondary) with the interval-censored fit line; Tobit slope per model and criterion |
| Fig 3 (margin) | `fig3_margin.py` | `margin_strata` | share P_c ≥ 0.9, share P_c^ε ≥ 0.9 and flat-group share by margin quartile (rev 8) |
